# Lintian tags that validate-incoming.sh does not fail the build on.
#
# Keep this list short and justify every entry. A tag either describes
# something we accept for good (statically-linked-binary) or a known defect
# that has to be removed again once upstream fixes it (aliased-location).

# The edulution binaries are pure Go, built with CGO_ENABLED=0 so they
# cross-compile without a toolchain. Static linking is the intended result.
statically-linked-binary

# TODO(edulution-eventhandler): ships its systemd unit in /lib/systemd/system
# instead of /usr/lib/systemd/system. Drop this entry once that is fixed.
aliased-location
